  "version": 1,
  "about": "Phase 7 screen awareness. Regions are fractions (0..1) of the captured window. Only the five read regions of a layout are ever read; each layout's exclude list must never overlap them (checked at load). Layouts are tried in order; the reader keeps the one that finds the chart. Title patterns: parts {ticker} {price} {arrow} {change} or literal text, matched against the start of the window title.",
